16985019,2025-11-03,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Problem with a purchase shown on your statement,Credit card company isn't resolving a dispute about a purchase on your statement,"I disputed a charge on my Capital One credit card for services that were never provided by a third-party biller. The transaction appeared on my statement in XX/XX/year>, but the failure to deliver the services was not clear until roughly 90120 days later, when it became evident that nothing would be performed. I filed my dispute promptly upon discovering that the services were not rendered.I filed my dispute as soon as the non-delivery became known. 

