Please note, if this matter is not resolved promptly, I reserve the right to submit an Identity Theft Report to the FTC, and to escalate my complaint to regulatory bodies including the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau ( CFPB ) and the Federal Trade Commission ( FTC ).

