website. I reached out via email and phone, and when I spoke with him, he confirmed that both XXXX XXXX and XXXX were acting fraudulently. XXXX XXXX told me directly that they had been scamming customers by falsely claiming to test, repair, or replace XXXX devices, and that they were not authorized by XXXX in any capacity. He said that they would try to steal my XXXX system and tell me it doesnt work. That was exactly what had happened in my case. 
