17371378,2025-11-19,Checking or savings account,Other banking product or service,Managing an account,Problem using a debit or ATM card,"I am writing to request your assistance regarding {$6600.00} in fraudulent charges on my Health Savings Account ( HSA ), which occurred over the past year and a half.

