17424456,2025-11-21,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"This is a NEW complaint concerning PenFed Credit Union only. This is NOT a duplicate of any prior complaint because PenFed has engaged in NEW violations, NEW actions, and NEW unlawful furnishing after prior notice. 

