XXXX. PenFed is violating N.Y. GBL 380-l ( Identity Theft Blocking ) Under New York law ( which mirrors FCRA 1681c-2 ), PenFed must : block identity-theft tradelines, notify ALL CRAs that the account is fraudulent, and cease all publication and re-publication.

PenFed has done NONE of these legally required steps.

