Notify Experian, Equifax, TransUnion, and all other CRAs that the account is fraudulent and identity-theft-related. 

Report the account as identity theft, with XXXX balance, and no negative history. 

Issue a written confirmation stating the account : will not be reinserted without full statutory compliance, will not be transferred, sold, or circulated again. 

Comply with the XX/XX/XXXX TRO and certify such compliance. 

Maintain all accurate, positive tradelines on my consumer file. 

Ensure that all legitimate closed accounts remain reported as Paid in Full / Pays As Agreed, with no late payments.

CONCLUSION This is a new and non-duplicate complaint.

PenFed is engaging in ongoing, post-notice, and post-TRO violations that require CFPB enforcement. 

