17920275,2025-11-29,Debt collection,Auto debt,Communication tactics,Frequent or repeated calls,"I am filing this complaint because a debt collector is repeatedly contacting me by phone without my permission and in an excessive manner. Their conduct violates my consumer rights under the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ) and implicates the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) because they are attempting to collect and/or report a debt that I dispute. 

